  "notes": "{関|かか}わる is an intransitive verb meaning to be connected or involved with.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive)\n\nPARTICLE USAGE:\n- 〜に{関|かか}わる (to be involved with ~)\n- 〜に{関|かか}わらず (regardless of ~)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {仕事|しごと}に{関|かか}わる (be involved in work)\n- {命|いのち}に{関|かか}わる (a matter of life and death)\n- {深|ふか}く{関|かか}わる (be deeply involved)\n\nRELATED VERBS:\n- {関係|かんけい}する: to be related to\n- {携|たずさ}わる: to be engaged in (more formal)",
